    -H "x-api-key: YOUR_INTERNAL_API_KEY"
  ```
  - New activities are recorded
  - Points are awarded
  - No duplicate points for same transaction

## ✅ Sync Daemon (For Thursday Auctions)

- [ ] **Verify sync daemon starts without errors**:
